  - Hobo Radio
  - "\uC77C\uBCF8\uC758 VRChat \uC720\uC800\uB4E4\uC774 \uC790\uC6D0\uD574 \uC6B4\uC601\uD558\uB294,
    \uC77C\uBCF8\uC5B4 \uC804\uC6A9 \uB77C\uB514\uC624\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n24\uC2DC\uAC04
    \uBC29\uC1A1\uD558\uBA70 \uD504\uB85C\uADF8\uB7A8\uC740 \uB9E4\uB2EC \uAC31\uC2E0\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - "\uD3B8\uC131\uD45C\xB7\uCD5C\uC2E0 \uC18C\uC2DD\uC740 X\uC5D0\uC11C"
  - "\uC9C0\uB0B4\uB294 \uBC95"
  - 'Here are a few ways to spend your time. Try them in any order you like.


    Put
    a dog on a leash and go for a walk. Pet a dog. Throw a ball or a disc. Offer
    a treat.


    From up on the hill, you can see the old farmhouse below. Look
    back now and then.


    In Dress, you can dress up a dog and choose the light
    that appears when you pet it. With Call, you can call a dog over and let it rest
    beside you.


    You do not have to do everything. Just watching is fine, too.'
  - "\uCE68\uC2E4\uC5D0\uC11C \uCC0D\uD78C \uD55C \uC7A5"
